      "item": 23,
      "ref": "D-G0-1",
      "title": "Isolation of untrusted researcher code",
      "status": "Approved (direction)",
      "due": "M4",
      "note": "AlphaLab provides safe research-execution interfaces and process orchestration; the isolation of untrusted researcher code is enforced by the host or deployment environment. A separate Python process alone is never represented as a secure sandbox."
    },
