      "item": 24,
      "ref": "D-G0-2",
      "title": "Numerical precision and canonical serialization policy",
      "status": "Approved (direction)",
      "due": "M2",
      "note": "A documented policy: deterministic calculations first, appropriate precision preserved, rounding only where numerical error analysis justifies it, cross-platform behaviour proved by reference tests. No arbitrary fixed rounding to conceal numerical differences."
